Z||000000||Monkeyman||12-19-2000||06:48 PM||||Here's the scenario:  I have an '85 GT without a winged decklid.  I'm getting a Formula decklid (and wing).  I need to swap out the power trunk release from the '85 GT decklid to the Formula decklid.  What do I need to do?  Is there anything special I need to know or can I just pay attention to the removal and do the opposite for installation?<P>Thanx, fellow Fieroholics!<P>||||reg||5
